        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia eya Yosia n'iwe Omukama Nebukadineza owa Babiloni yahaire engoma ya Yuda aha mwanya gwa Koniya eya Yehoyakimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Zedekia ogwo n'abaramatabe, n'abantu, ebyo Omukama yandagiire inye omurangi kubagambira tibabihuliire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Zedekia akwata Yehukali eya Shelemia, na Zetani omukuhani mutabani wa Maaseya, abatuma ahali inye nagamba ati, “Otushabire aha Mukama Ruhanga waitu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nkashangwa nkyagenda omu bantu ntaina kyondikwebabara, kuba bakaba batakanfungire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalidayo bakashangwa babunzire Yerusalemu. Kyonkai orwo bahulire okwo eihe lya Misiri lyaija, bairuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama angambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli nagamba ati: Ogambire omukama wa Yuda akutumire ahali inye, okwo eihe lya Farao elizire kumujuna likwatilire kugaruka Misiri owabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalidayo baragaruka batere ekigo eki, bakisinge bashube bakyokye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke kwebeiya kugamba muti, ‘Abakalidayo tibalikwija kututabalira na'kake;’ nibaija kubatabalira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangu n'orwo mwakusinga eihe lyona ly'Abakalidayo abo mulikurashana nabo, bakasigara emputa zonkai, buli muntu omu ihemalye, bakwimuka bokya ekigo eki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo eihe lya Farao lyagobire, Abakalidayo baruga Yerusalemu bairuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nirwo nanye nagiire Benjamini kubona omwate gwange omu banyaruganda bange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanabaire ndi aha Kihigi kya Benjamini, omukuru w'abaisherukare, eibaralye Iriya eya Shelemia, Shelemia eya Hanania, ankwata nagamba ati, “Iwe nogwera rubaju orw'Abakalidayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye mugambira nti, “Ebyo bishuba. Inye tinkagweleire rubaju rwa Bakalidayo.” Kyonkai Iriya tafa gampuliliza. Ankwata, antwalira abatwazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatwazi baija kundya amaisho, bantera, bashuba banfungira omwa Yonatani omukarani, kuba bakaba babandize kufungiramu abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanabaire namazire mabusi ebiro bingi omu karokoli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Zedekia antumaho, anyegeza. Antwara omwa wenene ambaza omu kihama ati, “Omukama aina ekyo yagambireyo?” Ngamba nti, “Ekyo yagambireyo kiliyo.” Aho mugambira okwo omukama wa Babiloni alikwija kumukwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshuba mubaza nti, “Honene mbere nkukoleire kabiki, iwe anga abaramata bawe, anga abantu bawe, kunfunga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarangi bawe balihai ababaire nibakugambira okwo omukama wa Babiloni atakutabalire anga kutabalira nsi egi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Rugaba rwange Omukama, ninkutagiliza ompulilize. Ohulire ekitako kyange kike, otanshubya mwa Yonatani omukarani ntaija nkagwamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Omukama Zedekia aragira kabanteka omu rubuga rw'abalinzi; buli kiro bata nibangulira omugate omu mbarabara y'abakozi b'emikate, kulemwa kuhika orwo emikate yahoisize omu kigo. Mba nikwo nyikara ntyo omu rubuga rw'abalinzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
